{'symbol': 'WBA', 'date': '2023-01-12 08:25:00', 'title': 'THIRTEENTH ANNUAL EXPRESSIONS BY WALGREENS HIGH SCHOOL ART CHALLENGE OPENS FOR ENTRIES', 'text': 'DEERFIELD, ILL.--( BUSINESS WIRE )--TEENAGERS NATIONWIDE CAN BEGIN SUBMITTING ENTRIES FOR THE 13TH ANNUAL EXPRESSIONS BY WALGREENS, AN ARTISTIC CHALLENGE FOR HIGH SCHOOL STUDENTS THAT AWARDS MONETARY PRIZES IN FOUR CATEGORIES: VISUAL ARTS, MEDIA ARTS, SPOKEN WORD, AND CREATIVE WRITING. ENTRIES ARE BEING ACCEPTED NOW THROUGH MARCH 31, 2023.'}